WEBVTT

00:10:29.208 --> 00:10:31.710
The policy questions
at their core are easy,

00:10:31.752 --> 00:10:33.420
they're simple, straightforward.

00:10:33.462 --> 00:10:37.758
Reconciling our communities,
our culture, our politics,

00:10:37.800 --> 00:10:39.301
are more difficult.

00:10:39.968 --> 00:10:43.847
But what we've seen across the country
is that across religion, across race,

00:10:43.889 --> 00:10:47.393
ethnicity, across politics, across gender,

00:10:47.434 --> 00:10:49.895
people are doing this work,
and it is heroic.

00:10:50.646 --> 00:10:52.189
In Twin Falls, Idaho,

00:10:52.231 --> 00:10:56.026
you have conservative dairymen
working with immigrants and refugees,

00:10:56.026 --> 00:10:58.362
some from Syria,

00:10:58.362 --> 00:11:01.907
to convene pastors, police chiefs
and business owners